# MikiConnect

## Slogan
Chat Without Limits

## Theme
Blue and White

## Logo
Blue letter M inside a chat bubble.

## Version 1.0 Features

- User Registration
- User Login
- User Profiles
- Home Feed
- Posts
- Likes
- Comments
- Private Chat
- Group Chat
- Stories
- Notifications
- Search
- Settings

## Future Features

- Voice Calls
- Video Calls
- Marketplace
- AI Assistant
- Communities
- Live Streaming0

